---
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import poster from '../assets/perfect-placement-demo-poster.png';
import { PERFECT_PLACEMENT_URL, RIPD_CASE_STUDY_URL, SPECDR_URL } from '../data/links';

const posterImage = await getImage({ src: poster, format: 'webp', width: 1200 });
const videoLabel =
  'A 20-second tour of Perfect Placement on demo data: Now, Needs you, River, a role, People, You and Settings';
---

<section id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title" class="work">
  <h2 id="work-title" class="section-title">Off the anvil</h2>

  <article id="open-source" class="feature">
    <div class="feature-copy">
      <p class="kicker">Shipped, open source</p>
      <h3>Perfect Placement</h3>
      <p class="body">Your job search, run by your agents, on your machine. It finds roles, scores fit, tailors materials and drafts outreach. It never sends or submits without you.</p>
      <a href={PERFECT_PLACEMENT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-amber try">Try it on GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-media">
      <video
        id="pp-demo"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
        poster={posterImage.src}
        width="1200"
        height="750"
        aria-label={videoLabel}
      >
        <source src="/media/perfect-placement-demo.webm" type="video/webm" />
        <source src="/media/perfect-placement-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
      <script is:inline>
        // Reduced motion: show the poster frame instead of autoplaying.
        (function () {
          var v = document.getElementById('pp-demo');
          if (v && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
            v.removeAttribute('autoplay');
            v.pause();
            v.controls = true;
          }
        })();
      </script>
    </div>
  </article>

  <div class="rows">
    <article class="row">
      <div class="row-head">
        <h3>Specdr</h3>
        <p class="status" style="color: var(--lilac)">Ongoing, with the Specdr team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>What comes after agile, for products that already exist. Proof-driven development: prove the problem, prove the solution, prove the impact. Customer signal becomes a working proof inside the real product, goes back to the customers who asked for it, and reaches engineering as evidence instead of a ticket.</p>
        <a href={SPECDR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="row-link">Read more at specdr.ai</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="row">
      <div class="row-head">
        <h3>RIP'D</h3>
        <p class="status" style="color: var(--amber)">Shipped</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>A trading card platform for collectors, with computer vision and AI-assisted grading. 40 organic daily users within three months of launch.</p>
        <a href={RIPD_CASE_STUDY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="row-link">Read the case study</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="row row-last">
      <div class="row-head">
        <h3>Pandora</h3>
        <p class="status" style="color: var(--cold)">In the forge</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>A self-hosted second brain: a personal context layer with curated agents on top. Open source is on the roadmap.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .work {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 112px 24px 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 56px;
  }
  .section-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .feature {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 40px 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .feature-copy {
    flex: 1 1 360px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .kicker {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  .feature h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .body {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .try {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    min-height: 48px;
  }
  .feature-media {
    flex: 999 1 520px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
  }
  .rows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 48px;
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .row-last {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .row-head {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .row h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 32px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .status {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .row-body {
    flex: 999 1 520px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .row-body p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .row-link {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
